# Figma code export kept locally as a design reference only - a disposable Vite/shadcn
# scaffold (its own package.json, component dump) re-exportable from Figma if needed again.
# Verified it sits outside frontend/, so frontend/tsconfig.json's include globs can't reach
# it and it can't affect the Next.js build; ignored here purely to keep it out of git history.
design/figma-export/
